<title>UK: Berisford Plc pretax profit dips.</title>
<headline>Berisford Plc pretax profit dips.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 28.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 12.5		  vs  14.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   3.0		  vs   2.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   4.5		  vs   3.0</p>
<p> Pretax, preexcept	 25.5		  vs  26.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   497.5		  vs 381.2</p>
<p> Interest payable	  12.1		  vs   8.3</p>
<p> Tax			    4.8		  vs   3.2</p>
<p> Net taxed		   19.5		  vs  23.7</p>
<p> Attributable		 6.9		  vs   4.6</p>
<p> Pay date		   January 31, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date  January 14, 1997</p>
<p> Ex-div date		January 6, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Berisford Plc manufactures commercial food equipment, building and consumer products and is also into agribusiness. Chairman John Sclater said the company's performance in the first seven weeks in its current financial year has been encouraging.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
